WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.000
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.680
No using SCPs to create tentacle monsters&nbsp;
- even if Dr. Palmer asks nicely!

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.640
There are a vast number of anomalous&nbsp;
technologies that would allow a bored&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.200
Dr. Bright to try his hand at playing god&nbsp;
with some genetic engineering - Including,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.520
in theory, creating tentacle monsters.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.840
This may seem innocent enough, but due&nbsp;
to certain Japanese censorship laws,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.800
tentacle monsters have taken&nbsp;
on a whole new meaning.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.280
Especially to one of Dr. Bright’s colleagues,&nbsp;
Dr. Palmer, who’ll happily tell you about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:36.000
her favorite anime: “My Husband is a&nbsp;
Tentacle Monster In Another World.”

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.120
Needless to say, the Foundation would prefer that&nbsp;
their employees do this kind of thing at home.

